        "rationale": "The reply ties together the green run, gh's \"cannot use --jq without --json\" error, the `mapfile < <(...)` construct hiding the failure from set -e, the empty REPOS array and the exit-0 branch, and it cites run 61001. Both halves of the fix are named, along with the reason each matters. It is candid that only `bash -n` was run and why the end-to-end check wasn't possible. One minor gap: it says set -e rather than noting that pipefail also cannot see a process substitution."
